# React Patterns

## Components

- Functional components only; no class components
- Pages are thin — compose feature components, delegate data to hooks
- Use shadcn primitives from `@/components/ui/`; do not duplicate them
- Use `Field`, `FieldLabel`, `FieldError` for form fields (not raw labels)
- Sheet/Dialog forms: external submit via `form` id + `type="submit"` button outside sheet

## Hooks

- Server/async state → React Query in `features/*/hooks/`
- Client/mock state → Zustand in `features/*/store/`
- Query keys: plural domain name (`["screens"]`, `["media", folderId]`)
- Mutations invalidate related query keys on success
- Extract reusable logic into custom hooks; keep components declarative

## Routing

- All pages lazy-loaded in `router/index.tsx` with `Suspense`
- Protected routes nest under `AppLayout` (not a separate `ProtectedRoute` component)
- Auth pages (`/login`, `/register`, etc.) are outside the layout

## Error handling

- `ErrorBoundary` wraps app in `App.tsx` with `ErrorFallback`
- Mutation errors: `toast.error(t('feature.error'))` in `onError`
- API errors: `getApiErrorMessage(error, t('feature.fallback'))` from `@/lib/api-error` (reads backend `error.message`)

## Toasts

Use `sonner` (`toast.success`, `toast.error`) with i18n messages.
